      "heading": "The lion was never random.",
      "lede": "It carries our history, what we believe about students, and the kind of partner we want to be.",
      "cards": [
        { "title": "The lion was always ours.", "body": "The lion has been a quiet symbol inside TanChes for years, part spirit animal and part reminder of how we want to show up. Putting it at the center of TANCHES.GG carried that history into everything we build next." },
        { "title": "Choosing to lead.", "body": "Esports is a crowded field, full of gear and promises. We didn’t want to be one more voice in it. The lion is our commitment to lead from the front, stay accountable, and keep showing up long after install day." },
        { "title": "Cubs learn through play.", "body": "Young lions learn everything through play: timing, focus, how to move as a team. Students do too. Game-based learning is how a lot of real skills get built." },
        { "title": "Raising leaders.", "body": "For many students, esports is the first time they captain a team, call a play, or run a broadcast. The lion is who we hope every student becomes: someone who leads on the screen and off it." },
        { "title": "Guarding the den.", "body": "Lions protect their young. We build safe, supervised, well-run spaces, from network security to coach training, so families and administrators can trust the room their kids walk into." }
